OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric canal bank repaired after
OL,4,Awater vole damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic canal is having part of its
OL,7,Fcrumbling bank restored by volunteers
OL,8,Fafter water voles burrowed into it for
OL,9,Fabout 30 years.
OL,11,FThe Wilts & Berks Canal Trust is
OL,12,Frepairing a 260m (853 ft) stretch of
OL,13,Fthe towpath between Westleaze and
OL,14,FKingshill, in Swindon, which was last
OL,15,Frestored in the 1990s.
OL,17,FSwindon branch chair and trust advocacy
OL,18,Fdirector, Chloe Ford, said the canal
OL,19,Fbank was "leaking", which meant the
OL,20,Ftowpath - currently closed daily
OL,21,Fbetween 09:00 and 15:30 BST for works -
OL,22,Fhad become "quite bumpy".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
