OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric canal bank repaired after
OL,4,Awater vole damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwindon councillor for the area, Janine
OL,7,FHowarth, said she was "really pleased"
OL,8,Fworks were taking place on what was a
OL,9,F"green corridor" and it was a "breath
OL,10,Fof fresh air" for town residents.
